 845:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *                                       where PCTQ1_max = 3 and DCTQ1_max = 31\n
